            "content": "ENVIRONMENT — this flow is built for:\n- Telegram account: an apiKey account holding a bot token (service appmixer:telegram).\n- Chat: group chat id -5393771328. The bot MUST already be a member of that group.\n- Retargeting: the chat id is a literal on every Telegram component in this flow — change all of them together, or the cleanup step will target a different chat than the one under test.\n- Fully automatic. This is the only coverage of the multipart upload branch in lib.sendMedia: GetFile stores the photo and SendDocument uploads it back. SendPhoto itself is driven with a plain URL here.",
